      "sourceText": "に応じて (JLPT N2) | Bunpro\nLoading user data...\nBunpro\nGrammar Info\nN2 Lesson 6: 8/20\nに\n応\n(\nおう\n)\nじて\nDepending or based on, According to, In response to, Suitable for or to\nDetails\nExamples\nResources\nに応じて\nDepending or based on, According to, In response to, Suitable for or to\nDetails\nExamples\nResources\nDetails\nExamples\nResources\nReady to transform your studies?\nLearn N5 in under a month!\nTry now, no credit card required!\nTry Bunpro\nLearn More\nStructure\nNoun +\nに\n応\n(\nおう\n)\nじ\n（\nて\n）\nNoun +\nに\n応\n(\nおう\n)\nじた\n+ Noun\nDetails\nRegister\nStandard\nAbout に応じて\nEnglish\nJapanese\nに\n応\n(\nおう\n)\nじて\nis a combination of に, and the て-form of the る-Verb\n応\n(\nおう\n)\nじる 'to apply to'. This grammar structure is often translated as 'depending on (A), (B)', or 'in response to (A), (B)'. However; in almost all cases, it is just indicating that (B) is something that is done in a way that is 'applicable' to what is necessary of (A).\nに\n応\n(\nおう\n)\nじて\nwill appear after nouns, or as\nに\n応\n(\nおう\n)\nじた\nwhen directly modifying a second noun.\nFun-fact\n応\n(\nおう\n)\nじる usually indicates the way something 'responds to' or 'answers' an issue on a case-by-case basis. Due to this, what happens in (B) will frequently indicate something that changes depending on the intensity or severity of (A).\nSynonyms\nExpand All\nに応えて\nにこたえて\nIn response to, Meet\nN2 Grammar\nに応えて means in response to expectations, requests, or demands, as in 要望に応えて商品を改良した (We improved the product in response to requests). に応じて means in line with or according to conditions, adapting as needed, as in 年齢に応じて料金が変わる (The fee changes according to age).\nRelated\nExpand All\nに沿って\nにそって\nAlong, In accordance with, In line with\nN2 Grammar\nに沿って and に応じて can both suggest doing something in line with a standard, but differ in nuance. に沿って means according to, as in 会社の方針に沿って行動する (act according to company policy). に応じて implies acting in response to or suitable for something, as in 客のニーズに応じてサービスを提供する (provide a service suitable for customers’ needs).\nにしたがって\nにしたがって\nAs, Following, As then, According to, In accordance with\nN2 Grammar\nに応じて and にしたがって can seem similar, but differ in nuance. に応じて means in response to something, as in アンケートの結果に応じて方針を決める (decide policy in response to the survey results). にしたがって refers to directly following guidelines or standards, as in 規則に従って (in accordance with the regulations).\n次第だ・次第で\nしだいだ\nDepending on, So\nN2 Grammar\nBoth can be translated as according to, but differ in nuance. に応じて emphasizes adapting or responding flexibly, as in 年齢に応じて料金が変わる (The fee changes according to age). 次第だ・次第で stresses that the outcome is directly determined by another factor, as in 成功するかどうかは準備次第である (Success depends on preparation).\nからして\nEven..., Judging from, Based on\nN2 Grammar\nに応じて shows flexible adjustment in proportion to conditions, as in 状況に応じて対応する (Respond according to the situation). からして emphasizes the basis for judgment, meaning judging from or even just from, often with emphasis, as in 態度からして気に入っていない (Judging from his attitude, he doesn’t like it).\nに合わせて・に合った\nにあわせて\nIn accordance with, Matching, Fitting, Suitable for, Adjust or tune to\nN3 Grammar\nBoth relate to the idea of one thing being dependent on another, but with different nuance and formality level. に応じて is a formal expression and conveys variation or response depending on conditions, e.g. 必要に応じてサポートする ('Support as needed'), while に合わせて・に合った is less formal and implies actively adjusting to match or suit something, e.g. 季節に合わせて洋服を選ぶ ('Choose clothes to match the season').\nMisc.\nExpand All\nをもとに\nをもとに\nBased on, From, According to\nN2 Grammar\nをもとに indicates a fixed source or basis for something, as in 実話をもとに小説を書く (Write a novel based on true events). に応じて shows flexible adjustment or response to conditions, as in 状況に応じて対応を決める (Decide the response according to the situation).\nVocab Coverage\nAll Bunpro Vocab that appears on this item.\nExpand List\nKnowledge Check\nExamples\n--:--\nSentence\nTranslation\nジムでは\n実力\n(\nじつりょく\n)\nに\n応\n(\nおう\n)\nじて\n、\n練習\n(\nれんしゅう\n)\nを\n選\n(\nえら\n)\nべるべきだ。\nAt the gym, you should choose exercises\nsuitable to\nyour ability. (\nin response to\n)\n赤\n(\nあか\n)\nん\n坊\n(\nぼう\n)\nのために\n年齢\n(\nねんれい\n)\nに\n応\n(\nおう\n)\nじた\nダイエットが\n必要\n(\nひつよう\n)\nです。\nFor a toddler, it is necessary to have a diet that is\nsuitable for\ntheir age.\n私\n(\nわたし\n)\n共\n(\nども\n)\nのホテルでは\nＶＩＰ\n(\nブイアイピー\n)\nレベルのニーズ\nに\n応\n(\nおう\n)\nじた\nサービスをご\n提供\n(\nていきょう\n)\nいたします。\nIn our hotel, we offer services\nsuitable for\nVIP needs. (\nin response to\n)\n日本\n(\nにほん\n)\n人\n(\nじん\n)\nは\n相手\n(\nあいて\n)\nへの\n尊敬\n(\nそんけい\n)\n度\n(\nど\n)\nに\n応\n(\nおう\n)\nじて\n、お\n辞儀\n(\nじぎ\n)\nの\n角度\n(\nかくど\n)\nを\n変\n(\nか\n)\nえる。\nThe Japanese change the angle of their bow\ndepending on\nthe degree of respect for the other party. (\nin response to\n)\n警察官\n(\nけいさつかん\n)\nは\n状態\n(\nじょうたい\n)\nや\n必要\n(\nひつよう\n)\nに\n応\n(\nおう\n)\nじて\n暴力\n(\nぼうりょく\n)\nを\n行使\n(\nこうし\n)\nできる\n場合\n(\nばあい\n)\nもあります。\nIn some cases, policemen can use force\ndepending on\ncircumstances or necessity. (\nin response to\n)\nGet more example sentences!\nPremium users get access to 12 example sentences on all Grammar Points.\nTry Bunpro\nSelf-Study Sentences\nStudy your own way!\nAdd sentences and study them alongside Bunpro sentences.\nTry Bunpro\nOnline\nFurther breakdown and examples\nJapaneseTest4You\nOffline\nThere are no Offline resources listed for 「に応じて」.\nYou can\nsubmit a resource for review\n. Resources are constantly updated, come back later to see new additions!\nTrack Resources!\nBunpro tracks all of the resources you’ve visited, and offers relevant bookmarks of physical books to help with offline tracking.\nTry Bunpro\nに応じて – Grammar Discussion\nMost Recent Replies (2 in total)\nkakapo\nI might be wrong, but I feel this example is misleading.\nFuga\nWe have added a 、before 練習 to make it clear that we are asking for users to submit に応じて as the answer!\nGot questions about に応じて?\nJoin us to discuss, ask, and learn together!\nJoin the Discussion\nBunpro\nSimplifying Japanese\nOfficial Apps\nLearn More\nJoin us!\nCompany\nNews\nCareers\nAbout Us\nTestimonials\nAcknowledgements\nFor Teachers\nJapanese\nOfficial Forums\nContent Search\nReading Practice\nGrammar Library\nHiragana & Katakana\nSupport\nContact Us\nSupport & FAQ\n© 2026, Bunpro SRS.\nRead our\nTerms of Service\n,\nPrivacy Policy\nand\nCompany Overview\n.\nMade with\n❤️\nfrom Osaka.\nEnglish",
