      "sourceText": "に照らして・に照らすと (JLPT N1) | Bunpro\nLoading user data...\nBunpro\nGrammar Info\nN1 Lesson 8: 6/20\nに\n照\n(\nて\n)\nらして\nIn light of, Based on, According to, Referencing, Comparing against, In view of\nDetails\nExamples\nResources\nに照らして・に照らすと\nIn light of, Based on, According to, Referencing, Comparing against, In view of\nDetails\nExamples\nResources\nDetails\nExamples\nResources\nReady to transform your studies?\nLearn N5 in under a month!\nTry now, no credit card required!\nTry Bunpro\nLearn More\nStructure\nNoun +\nに\n照\n(\nて\n)\nらして\n(1)\nNoun (A) +\nに\n照\n(\nて\n)\nらした\n+ Noun (B)\n(1)\nに\n照\n(\nて\n)\nらす\nと\nDetails\nRegister\nStandard\nAbout に照らして・に照らすと\nEnglish\nJapanese\nに\n照\n(\nて\n)\nらして\nis an expression based on the standard meaning of the う-Verb\n照\n(\nて\n)\nらす 'to illuminate', and is primarily used comparatively in a similar way to 'in light of' in English. This comparative meaning aims to illustrate (B) from the perspective of (A), and usually refers to situations, level of experience, or something similar.\nTo use this structure, attach the case-marking particle に to the end of a noun, then follow it with\n照\n(\nて\n)\nらして. If a second noun will be modified directly, then\n照\n(\nて\n)\nらした will be used instead.\nKeep in mind that the に in this structure is marking (A) as the 'doer' of\n照\n(\nて\n)\nらす 'to illuminate', as it is a transitive verb. This means that the structure has a more literal translation of '(B) as reflected by (A)'. This can also be thought of as 'as made clear by (A), (B)', 'as made evident by (A), (B)'. (B) will almost always be a judgment that is logically based on (A).\nVocab Coverage\nAll Bunpro Vocab that appears on this item.\nExpand List\nKnowledge Check\nExamples\n--:--\nSentence\nTranslation\nアルバイトをすることは\n学校\n(\nがっこう\n)\nの\n規則\n(\nきそく\n)\nに\n照\n(\nて\n)\nらして\n規則\n(\nきそく\n)\n違反\n(\nいはん\n)\nになる。\nPart-time working is a violation\nin light of\nschool rules.\n彼女\n(\nかのじょ\n)\nの\n生活\n(\nせいかつ\n)\n習慣\n(\nしゅうかん\n)\nに\n照\n(\nて\n)\nらして\n罪\n(\nつみ\n)\nがないことを\n宣言\n(\nせんげん\n)\nされた。\nIn light of\nher everyday life (alibi), she has been declared innocent.\n我々\n(\nわれわれ\n)\nの\n基準\n(\nきじゅん\n)\nに\n照\n(\nて\n)\nらすと\n、この\n製品\n(\nせいひん\n)\nを\n粗悪品\n(\nそあくひん\n)\nと\n言\n(\nい\n)\nう\n人\n(\nひと\n)\nは\n少\n(\nすく\n)\nなくない。\nThere are quite a few people that would call this product inferior\nin light of\nour standards.\n国内\n(\nこくない\n)\nの\n状況\n(\nじょうきょう\n)\nに\n照\n(\nて\n)\nらすと\n、\n国外\n(\nこくがい\n)\nからの\n石油\n(\nせきゆ\n)\nの\n購入\n(\nこうにゅう\n)\nは\n必要\n(\nひつよう\n)\nである。\nIn light of\nthe domestic situation, purchasing petrol abroad is necessary...\n社内\n(\nしゃない\n)\n規程\n(\nきてい\n)\nに\n照\n(\nて\n)\nらして\n、\n作業員\n(\nさぎょういん\n)\nの\n効率性\n(\nこうりつせい\n)\nの\n検証\n(\nけんしょう\n)\nを\n行\n(\nおこな\n)\nう。\nTo perform the validation of workers' efficiency\nin accordance with\ncompany regulations.\nGet more example sentences!\nPremium users get access to 12 example sentences on all Grammar Points.\nTry Bunpro\nSelf-Study Sentences\nStudy your own way!\nAdd sentences and study them alongside Bunpro sentences.\nTry Bunpro\nOnline\nに照らして\nJapaneseTest4You\nOffline\nShin Kanzen Master N1 Bunpou\nPage 94\nTrack Resources!\nBunpro tracks all of the resources you’ve visited, and offers relevant bookmarks of physical books to help with offline tracking.\nTry Bunpro\nに照らして・に照らすと – Grammar Discussion\nThere's currently no discussion for に照らして・に照らすと\nAsk questions and learn together with other Bunpro users!\nJoin the Discussion\nBunpro\nSimplifying Japanese\nOfficial Apps\nLearn More\nJoin us!\nCompany\nNews\nCareers\nAbout Us\nTestimonials\nAcknowledgements\nFor Teachers\nJapanese\nOfficial Forums\nContent Search\nReading Practice\nGrammar Library\nHiragana & Katakana\nSupport\nContact Us\nSupport & FAQ\n© 2026, Bunpro SRS.\nRead our\nTerms of Service\n,\nPrivacy Policy\nand\nCompany Overview\n.\nMade with\n❤️\nfrom Osaka.\nEnglish",
