with close friends (and should be avoided with superiors like teachers/bosses, as it can sound demanding in those cases).\nVocab Coverage\nAll Bunpro Vocab that appears on this item.\nExpand List\nKnowledge Check\nExamples\n--:--\nSentence\nTranslation\nなんで\nですか？\nWhy\nis that?\nなんで\nそれを\n聞\n(\nき\n)\nくの？\nWhy\ndo you ask that?\nなんで\n彼\n(\nかれ\n)\nと\n結婚\n(\nけっこん\n)\nしたの？\nWhy\ndid you marry him?\nなんで\nこれも\n入\n(\nい\n)\nれるんですか？\nWhy\nare you putting this in as well?\nなんで\n今日\n(\nきょう\n)\nなの？\nWhy\nis it today?\nGet more example sentences!\nPremium users get access to 12 example sentences on all Grammar Points.\nTry Bunpro\nSelf-Study Sentences\nStudy your own way!\nAdd sentences and study them alongside Bunpro sentences.\nTry Bunpro\nOnline\nThere are no Online resources listed for 「なんで」.\nYou can\nsubmit a resource for review\n. Resources are constantly updated, come back later to see new additions!\nOffline\nThere are no Offline resources listed for 「なんで」.\nYou can\nsubmit a resource for review\n. Resources are constantly updated, come back later to see new additions!\nTrack Resources!\nBunpro tracks all of the resources you’ve visited, and offers relevant bookmarks of physical books to help with offline tracking.\nTry Bunpro\nなんで – Grammar Discussion\nThere's currently no discussion for なんで\nAsk questions and learn together with other Bunpro users!\nJoin the Discussion\nBunpro\nSimplifying Japanese\nOfficial Apps\nLearn More\nJoin us!\nCompany\nNews\nCareers\nAbout Us\nTestimonials\nAcknowledgements\nFor Teachers\nJapanese\nOfficial Forums\nContent Search\nReading Practice\nGrammar Library\nHiragana & Katakana\nSupport\nContact Us\nSupport & FAQ\n© 2026, Bunpro SRS.\nRead our\nTerms of Service\n,\nPrivacy Policy\nand\nCompany Overview\n.\nMade with\n❤️\nfrom Osaka.\nEnglish",
